  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供操作系统安全凭据存储（macOS Keychain / Windows Credential Manager / Linux Secret Service）的读写能力，用于安全地存储密码、令牌等敏感信息。",
    "en-US": "Secure credential storage using OS keychain (macOS Keychain / Windows Credential Manager / Linux Secret Service) for passwords, tokens, and other sensitive data.",
    "zh-TW": "提供操作系統安全凭据存儲（macOS Keychain / Windows Credential Manager / Linux Secret Service）的读写能力，用于安全地存儲密碼、令牌等敏感資訊。",
    "ja": "OSキーチェーン(macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service)によるセキュアな資格情報ストレージ。パスワード・トークン・機密データ。",
    "ko": "OS 키체인(macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service)을 사용한 보안 자격 증명 저장. 비밀번호, 토큰, 민감 데이터.",
    "es": "Almacenamiento seguro de credenciales con el llavero del SO (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service). Contraseñas, tokens y datos sensibles.",
    "fr": "Stockage sécurisé via le trousseau OS (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service). Mots de passe, jetons et données sensibles.",
    "de": "Sichere Anmeldedatenspeicherung mit OS-Schlüsselbund (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service). Passwörter, Token, sensible Daten.",
    "pt-BR": "Armazenamento seguro de credenciais via keychain do SO (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service). Senhas, tokens e dados sensíveis.",
    "ru": "Безопасное хранение учётных данных через связку ключей ОС (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service). Пароли, токены и конфиденциальные данные.",
    "ar": "تخزين بيانات اعتماد آمن عبر سلسلة مفاتيح النظام (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service). كلمات مرور ورموز وبيانات حساسة.",
    "hi": "OS कीचेन (macOS Keychain/Windows Credential Manager/Linux Secret Service) से सुरक्षित क्रेडेंशियल स्टोरेज। पासवर्ड, टोकन और संवेदनशील डेटा।"
